### Structure (3 theory beats + 4 widgets, m5, 14 min)
1. **theory** — *Zespół Rasmussena: jedna półkula, która zanika* — definition, 3 stadia, EPC/zespół Kożewnikowa, niedowład/hemianopsja, MRI findings + inline MRI image. (src: Bien 2005, Wikipedia)
2. **quiz** — recognise EPC/Kożewnikow + hemisferotomia as treatment of choice (correct = B)
3. **theory** — *Histopatologia i leczenie* — CD8 T-cell histo (inline image) → why immunotherapy only slows → hemisferotomia, the 4%/3-months rule, paradoxical surgical criteria. (src: Bien 2005)
4. **plotImage** — generated urgency curve (delay vs seizure-freedom %), full axes/labels/ticks/legend/grid; `sourceCode` matches the saved PNG
5. **theory** — *FIRES i NORSE* — febrile trigger 24h–2wk, lekooporny → OIOM, ~10% mortality, IL-1/IL-6, bilateral T2 MRI (inline image), anakinra ≤2 weeks; FIRES = NORSE in children. (src: Hirsch 2018)
6. **dataTable** — Rasmussen vs FIRES/NORSE differential (7 rows)
7. **quiz** — post-infectious refractory SE → FIRES/anakinra (correct = C)
### Grounding & assets
