- 3 images downloaded from Wikimedia Commons (Rasmussen MRI CC BY-SA 3.0, CD8 biopsy CC BY-SA 3.0, FIRES MRI CC BY 4.0), cached locally with descriptive filenames and credited inline.
- Quiz `correct` indices spread (B, C); both single-select.
