5. **quiz** (multi) — features pointing to PNES vs seizure (correct = A/B/D, 3 of 5)
6. **plotImage** — prolactin fold-rise by event type (rendered PNG with full axes; teaching nuance: frontal seizures also don't raise prolactin)
7. **dragMatch** — convulsive syncope vs epileptic seizure feature sorting
