**Differentiation:** kept it case-based to avoid duplicating the existing `genetyka-padaczek` lesson.
**Assets:** downloaded 3 stable Wikimedia Commons images locally (voltage-gated sodium channel, X-chromosome inactivation, Socrates bust) into `assets/images/`; no external image URLs remain. Sources: 4 lesson-level entries from the matching `sources.md` block plus section-level attributions. I did not touch `scripts/ralph/`, `course.json`, or any other lesson.
